This product includes the Qloo-powered taste-match subset of the Ayma product,
created for the Qloo Agentic Hackathon (October 2026): a shared-taste score and
taste-based date ideas for a pair, built on the Qloo Taste / Insights API.

Only the newly built, non-sensitive Qloo components are included here. Ayma's
core product (auth, matching, the Firestore data layer, the Gemini client, the
voice-agent worker, the Flutter app shell) is private and is NOT included; the
small stand-ins under backend/_stubs/ reproduce only the narrow interfaces the
extracted code and the self-contained tests exercise.

Qloo entity names and the illustrative tags in backend/qloo_fixture.json are
used only to drive the offline demo and are not Qloo data.

